      "content": "it's just so much money to go to the er for nothing... my husband says it's probably just low blood pressure from not eating enough today. if i just take a really strong dose of some ibuprofen and lay down for a few hours, will that help settle everything? i really just want to sleep it off and wake up feeling normal.",
